        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Typical data of current machines sold for the mechanical treatment of WEEE devices.\n\n# Included processes\nThis module includes material, production efforts (transportation, energy, …) and the infrastructure for the production of all the machineries used for the mechanical treatment of WEEE devices. No information about emissions (air, water) and waste are included.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
